1.ProGlove Software
(a) ProGlove Software means the (1) Scanner Firmware Gen 1, (2) Scanner Firmware Gen 2,
installed on your ProGlove devices, downloadable from the Insight Webportal and/or any other
source, (3) ProGlove Insight Mobile (Android) (previously known as ProGlove Connect) downloadable
through the Insight Webportal or any other source, (4) Insight Mobile File Assistant software
downloadable through the Insight Webportal or any other source, (5) the Feature Demo Application,
and/or the Trade Fair Demo Application software downloadable through the Insight Webportal or any
other source, (6) the Insight Mobile (iOS) software downloadable through the Insight Webportal or
any other source, (7) Insight Mobile (watchOS) software downloadable through the Insight Webportal
or any other source, (8) Insight Mobile Demo Application (iOS) software downloadable through the
Insight Webportal or any other source, (9) Insight Mobile (SDK) software downloadable through the
Insight Webportal or any other source, (10) the Gateway application firmware installed on your
ProGlove Gateway device and/or downloadable from the Insight Webportal or any other source, or
(11) documentation, (code) samples and interfaces to any of the foregoing, each accompanying this
License Agreement and described as ProGlove Software in the documentation or release note
(“ProGlove Software”). ProGlove Software is licensed, not sold, to you by Workaround GmbH
