License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL 2.0)
Version: 2025.1.31
License
This package contains a modified version of ca-bundle.crt:
ca-bundle.crt -- Bundle of CA Root Certificates
This is a bundle of X.509 certificates of public Certificate
Authorities
(CA). These were automatically extracted from Mozilla's
root certificates
file (certdata.txt). This file can be found in the mozilla
source tree:
https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/file/tip/security/nss/
lib/ckfw/builtins/certdata.txt
It contains the certificates in PEM format and therefore
can be directly used with curl / libcurl / php_curl, or with
an Apache+mod_ssl webserver for SSL client
authentication.
Just configure this file as the SSLCACertificateFile.#
